  "title": "Scaling localization at Atlassian: keeping translation at the pace of AI-era development",
  "summary": "When developers started building with AI assistants, they began shipping features several times faster. That acceleration created a new challenge: every feature added text to translate, and the volume grew faster than our localization process could absorb. We responded on both ends: AI drafts translations, and tooling fixes source code before it reaches translation.",
